@startuml 双向评价序列图
' ==========================================
' 心理学被试招募平台 - 序列图3：双向评价
' 成员3：系统建模
' ==========================================

title 序列图3：双向评价流程

actor "被试\n(Subject)" as Subject
actor "研究者\n(Researcher)" as Researcher
participant "小程序/Web" as Client
participant "后端API\n(Spring Boot)" as API
database "MySQL\n数据库" as DB

== 支付确认完成，触发评价 ==

API -> API: 支付状态变为 CONFIRMED\n触发双向评价流程

API -> DB: INSERT INTO notifications\n(被试, REVIEW_REQUIRED)
activate DB
DB --> API: 通知创建成功
deactivate DB

API -> DB: INSERT INTO notifications\n(研究者, REVIEW_REQUIRED)
activate DB
DB --> API: 通知创建成功
deactivate DB

API -> Subject: 推送"请评价研究者"
API -> Researcher: 推送"请评价被试"

== 并行：双方评价 ==

par
  group 被试评价研究者
    Subject -> Client: 进入评价页面
    activate Client

    Client -> API: GET /api/reviews/experiment/{id}
    activate API
    API -> DB: 查询实验信息
    activate DB
    DB --> API: 返回实验信息
    deactivate DB
    API --> Client: 返回实验信息
    deactivate API

    Client --> Subject: 显示评价表单\n(总评分+沟通+专业+准时+文字+匿名)

    Subject -> Client: 填写评价\n总评5星, 沟通4, 专业5, 准时5\n勾选"匿名评价"

    Client -> API: POST /api/reviews\n(SUBJECT_TO_RESEARCHER, rating=5, isAnonymous=true)
    activate API

    API -> DB: 检查是否重复评价
    activate DB
    DB --> API: 无重复
    deactivate DB

    API -> DB: INSERT INTO reviews
    activate DB
    DB --> API: 评价创建成功
    deactivate DB

    API -> DB: SELECT AVG(rating)\n更新研究者平均评分
    activate DB
    DB --> API: 返回平均评分
    deactivate DB

    API -> DB: UPDATE users\nSET researcher_rating = avg
    activate DB
    DB --> API: 更新成功
    deactivate DB

    API -> DB: INSERT INTO notifications\n(研究者, REVIEW_RECEIVED)
    activate DB
    DB --> API: 通知创建成功
    deactivate DB

    API --> Client: 评价提交成功
    deactivate API

    Client --> Subject: 显示"评价提交成功"
    deactivate Client

    API -> Researcher: 推送"收到新评价"\n(匿名：仅显示评分)
  end

  group 研究者评价被试
    Researcher -> Client: 进入评价页面
    activate Client

    Client -> API: GET /api/registrations/experiment/{id}
    activate API
    API -> DB: 查询被试列表(匿名ID)
    activate DB
    DB --> API: 返回被试列表
    deactivate DB
    API --> Client: 返回被试列表
    deactivate API

    Client --> Researcher: 显示评价表单\n(总评分+沟通+配合度+准时+文字)

    Researcher -> Client: 填写评价\n总评4星, 沟通4, 配合4, 准时5

    Client -> API: POST /api/reviews\n(RESEARCHER_TO_SUBJECT, rating=4, isAnonymous=false)
    activate API

    API -> DB: 检查是否重复评价
    activate DB
    DB --> API: 无重复
    deactivate DB

    API -> DB: INSERT INTO reviews
    activate DB
    DB --> API: 评价创建成功
    deactivate DB

    API -> DB: INSERT INTO reputation_logs\n(change_type=ON_TIME, score_delta=+2)
    activate DB
    DB --> API: 信誉记录创建
    deactivate DB

    API -> DB: UPDATE users\nSET reputation_score += 2
    activate DB
    DB --> API: 信誉分更新成功
    deactivate DB

    API -> DB: INSERT INTO notifications\n(被试, REVIEW_RECEIVED)
    activate DB
    DB --> API: 通知创建成功
    deactivate DB

    API --> Client: 评价提交成功
    deactivate API

    Client --> Researcher: 显示"评价提交成功"
    deactivate Client

    API -> Subject: 推送"收到新评价\n信誉分+2"
  end
end

== 双方评价完成 ==

note over API
  **双向评价完成**
  双方均可看到对方评分
  匿名评价显示为"匿名用户"
  评价作为信誉分和研究者评级的依据
end note

@enduml
